</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e8c5a683ce83b890e0def1ec086d6e28efa22fbc" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -3.671ex; width:33.58ex; height:8.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{k}^{BM}(S^{1}\times \mathbb {R} )={\begin{cases}\mathbb {Z} &amp;k=1\\\mathbb {Z} &amp;k=2\\0&amp;{\text{otherwise}}\end{cases}}}"/></span></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="13" id="mw4g" aria-labelledby="Real_n-space_minus_a_point"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Real_n-space_minus_a_point">Real n-space minus a point</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Borel%E2%80%93Moore_homology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=13" title="Edit section: Real n-space minus a point"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mw4w">Using the long exact sequence in Borel-Moore homology, we get (for <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt56" id="mw5A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"n>1"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle n>1}">
