<p id="mw6g">From the first sequence we get that</p>

<p id="mw6w"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt59" id="mw7A" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"H_n^{BM}(\\R ^n) \\cong H_n^{BM}(\\R ^n-\\{0\\})"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{n}^{BM}(\mathbb {R} ^{n})\cong H_{n}^{BM}(\mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\})}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
