    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H_{n}^{BM}(\mathbb {R} ^{n})\cong H_{n}^{BM}(\mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\})}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/20ee2efcf4dd19e8d6b9cd4c82dc80e3a5fed20e" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:29.458ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{n}^{BM}(\mathbb {R} ^{n})\cong H_{n}^{BM}(\mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\})}"/></span></p>

<p id="mw7Q">and from the second we get that</p>

<p id="mw7g"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt60" id="mw7w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"H_1^{BM}(\\R ^n-\\{0\\}) \\cong H_0^{BM}(\\{0\\})"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}(\mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\})\cong H_{0}^{BM}(\{0\})}">
  <semantics>
