<p id="mw8g">We can interpret these non-zero homology classes using the following observations:</p>
<ol id="mw8w"><li id="mw9A">There is the homotopy equivalence <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt62" id="mw9Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\R ^n-\\{0\\} \\simeq S^{n-1}."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\}\simeq S^{n-1}.}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">{</mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">}</mo>
        <mo>≃<!-- ≃ --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
            <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>.</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\}\simeq S^{n-1}.}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/1b68dad5733bfd84ab769e7d860992d0904e0b72" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:17.81ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\}\simeq S^{n-1}.}"/></span></li>
<li id="mw9g">A topological isomorphism <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt63" id="mw9w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"\\R ^n-\\{0\\} \\cong S^{n-1} \\times \\R _{>0}."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\}\cong S^{n-1}\times \mathbb {R} _{>0}.}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">{</mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">}</mo>
        <mo>≅<!-- ≅ --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
            <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>×<!-- × --></mo>
        <msub>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>></mo>
            <mn>0</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>.</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\}\cong S^{n-1}\times \mathbb {R} _{>0}.}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/5304b2a590bc85821a605b7e16f4ab438a21c5fa" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:24.662ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} ^{n}-\{0\}\cong S^{n-1}\times \mathbb {R} _{>0}.}"/></span></li></ol>

<p id="mw-A">hence we can use the computation for the infinite cylinder to interpret <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt64" id="mw-Q" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H_n^{BM}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{n}^{BM}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H_{n}^{BM}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/76e99760df0b6ef5f71c468acd68b2b218f95430" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:5.31ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{n}^{BM}}"/></span> as the homology class represented by <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt65" id="mw-g" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"S^{n-1}\\times\\R _{>0}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle S^{n-1}\times \mathbb {R} _{>0}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msup>
          <mi>S</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>n</mi>
            <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>×<!-- × --></mo>
        <msub>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>></mo>
            <mn>0</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle S^{n-1}\times \mathbb {R} _{>0}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/65e45b080393f90cd09271b191a8d2f79aae8dba" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:11.692ex; height:3.009ex;" alt="{\displaystyle S^{n-1}\times \mathbb {R} _{>0}}"/></span> and <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt66" id="mw-w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H_1^{BM}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
