    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} _{>0}.}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/8f022b8d95154d2268b8756e667745d5ad28ded9" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.671ex; width:4.658ex; height:2.509ex;" alt="{\displaystyle \mathbb {R} _{>0}.}"/></span></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="14" id="mw_Q" aria-labelledby="Plane_with_Points_Removed"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Plane_with_Points_Removed">Plane with Points Removed</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Borel%E2%80%93Moore_homology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=14" title="Edit section: Plane with Points Removed"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mw_g">Let <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt68" id="mw_w" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X = \\R^2 - \\{p_1,\\ldots, p_k \\}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X=\mathbb {R} ^{2}-\{p_{1},\ldots ,p_{k}\}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <msup>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">{</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>p</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <mo>…<!-- … --></mo>
        <mo>,</mo>
        <msub>
          <mi>p</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>k</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msub>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">}</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X=\mathbb {R} ^{2}-\{p_{1},\ldots ,p_{k}\}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/37a5e954a8fd885a0d12cf9a003c5f755f01cb98" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:22.636ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X=\mathbb {R} ^{2}-\{p_{1},\ldots ,p_{k}\}}"/></span> have <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt69" id="mwAQA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"k"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle k}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>k</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle k}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/c3c9a2c7b599b37105512c5d570edc034056dd40" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.211ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle k}"/></span>-distinct points removed. Notice the previous computation with the fact that Borel-Moore homology is an isomorphism invariant gives this computation for the case <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt70" id="mwAQE" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"k = 1"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle k=1}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>k</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mn>1</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle k=1}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/6c035ffa69b5bca8bf2d16c3da3aaad79a8bcbfa" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:5.472ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle k=1}"/></span>. In general, we will find a <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt71" id="mwAQI" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"1"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle 1}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mn>1</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle 1}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/92d98b82a3778f043108d4e20960a9193df57cbf" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.162ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle 1}"/></span>-class corresponding to a loop around a point, and the fundamental class <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt72" id="mwAQM" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"[X]"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle [X]}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mo stretchy="false">[</mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">]</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle [X]}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/fadb3aef0836cb1d004479f470703a45972bf8fe" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:3.274ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle [X]}"/></span> in <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt73" id="mwAQQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H_2^{BM}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{2}^{BM}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H_{2}^{BM}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/bb2f53a6f4cb6caf3702e1ae28b7949a89f2e360" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:5.31ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{2}^{BM}}"/></span>.</p>
<!--
Can this can be shown using Meyer&#x2D;Vietoris?
-->

</section><section data-mw-section-id="15" id="mwAQU" aria-labelledby="Double_Cone"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Double_Cone">Double Cone</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Borel%E2%80%93Moore_homology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=15" title="Edit section: Double Cone"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAQY">Consider the double cone <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt74" id="mwAQc" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X = \\mathbb{V}(x^2 + y^2 - z^2) \\subset \\R ^3"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X=\mathbb {V} (x^{2}+y^{2}-z^{2})\subset \mathbb {R} ^{3}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mi mathvariant="double-struck">V</mi>
        </mrow>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>x</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>+</mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>y</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo>−<!-- − --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>z</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>⊂<!-- ⊂ --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">R</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>3</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X=\mathbb {V} (x^{2}+y^{2}-z^{2})\subset \mathbb {R} ^{3}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/0f1f99ca2e17a99f6271ddb14fef548719d0f8cf" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:26.821ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X=\mathbb {V} (x^{2}+y^{2}-z^{2})\subset \mathbb {R} ^{3}}"/></span>. If we take <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt75" id="mwAQg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"U = X \\setminus \\{0\\}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle U=X\setminus \{0\}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo class="MJX-variant">∖<!-- ∖ --></mo>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">{</mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
        <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">}</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle U=X\setminus \{0\}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/754a0e012f472fc6c99ffd2892fd62d7534230e9" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:12.543ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle U=X\setminus \{0\}}"/></span> then the long exact sequence shows</p>

<p id="mwAQk"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt76" id="mwAQo" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"\\begin{align}\nH_2^{BM}(X) &amp;= \\Z^{\\oplus 2} \\\\\nH_1^{BM}(X) &amp;= \\Z \\\\\nH_k^{BM}(X) &amp;= 0 &amp;&amp; \\text{ for } k \\not\\in \\{1,2\\}\n\\end{align}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}H_{2}^{BM}(X)&amp;=\mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 2}\\H_{1}^{BM}(X)&amp;=\mathbb {Z} \\H_{k}^{BM}(X)&amp;=0&amp;&amp;{\text{ for }}k\not \in \{1,2\}\end{aligned}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mtable columnalign="right left right left right left right left right left right left" rowspacing="3pt" columnspacing="0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em" displaystyle="true">
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>2</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>X</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
              </mtd>
              <mtd>
                <mi></mi>
                <mo>=</mo>
                <msup>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mo>⊕<!-- ⊕ --></mo>
                    <mn>2</mn>
                  </mrow>
                </msup>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>1</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>X</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
              </mtd>
              <mtd>
                <mi></mi>
                <mo>=</mo>
                <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                  <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
                </mrow>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>k</mi>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>X</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
              </mtd>
              <mtd>
                <mi></mi>
                <mo>=</mo>
                <mn>0</mn>
              </mtd>
              <mtd></mtd>
              <mtd>
                <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                  <mtext> for </mtext>
                </mrow>
                <mi>k</mi>
                <mo>∉</mo>
                <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">{</mo>
                <mn>1</mn>
                <mo>,</mo>
                <mn>2</mn>
                <mo fence="false" stretchy="false">}</mo>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
          </mtable>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}H_{2}^{BM}(X)&amp;=\mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 2}\\H_{1}^{BM}(X)&amp;=\mathbb {Z} \\H_{k}^{BM}(X)&amp;=0&amp;&amp;{\text{ for }}k\not \in \{1,2\}\end{aligned}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/4a580944f28733e7ffa9a9a0d13976a4069110eb" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -4.175ex; margin-bottom: -0.33ex; width:35.16ex; height:10.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}H_{2}^{BM}(X)&amp;=\mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 2}\\H_{1}^{BM}(X)&amp;=\mathbb {Z} \\H_{k}^{BM}(X)&amp;=0&amp;&amp;{\text{ for }}k\not \in \{1,2\}\end{aligned}}}"/></span></p>

</section><section data-mw-section-id="16" id="mwAQs" aria-labelledby="Genus_Two_Curve_with_Three_Points_Removed"><div class="mw-heading mw-heading3"><h3 id="Genus_Two_Curve_with_Three_Points_Removed">Genus Two Curve with Three Points Removed</h3><span class="mw-editsection"><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">[</span><a href="/w/index.php?title=Borel%E2%80%93Moore_homology&amp;action=edit&amp;section=16" title="Edit section: Genus Two Curve with Three Points Removed"><span>edit</span></a><span class="mw-editsection-bracket">]</span></span></div>
<p id="mwAQw">Given a genus two curve (<a rel="mw:WikiLink" href="https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Riemann_surface" title="Riemann surface" id="mwAQ0">Riemann surface</a>) <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt77" id="mwAQ4" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"X"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle X}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>X</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle X}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/68baa052181f707c662844a465bfeeb135e82bab" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.98ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle X}"/></span> and three points <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt78" id="mwAQ8" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"F"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle F}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>F</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle F}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/545fd099af8541605f7ee55f08225526be88ce57" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.741ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle F}"/></span>, we can use the long exact sequence to compute the Borel-Moore homology of <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt79" id="mwARA" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"U = X \\setminus F."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle U=X\setminus F.}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mi>X</mi>
        <mo class="MJX-variant">∖<!-- ∖ --></mo>
        <mi>F</mi>
        <mo>.</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle U=X\setminus F.}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/1f89e4e97f8139fa50a387ee45ff06ddafc7467d" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.838ex; width:11.443ex; height:2.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle U=X\setminus F.}"/></span> This gives</p>

<p id="mwARE"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt80" id="mwARI" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"\\begin{align}\n    H_2^{BM}(F) \\to &amp; H_2^{BM}(X) \\to H_2^{BM}(U)     \\\\\n\\to H_1^{BM}(F) \\to &amp; H_1^{BM}(X) \\to H_1^{BM}(U)     \\\\\n\\to H_0^{BM}(F) \\to &amp; H_0^{BM}(X) \\to H_0^{BM}(U) \\to  0\n\\end{align}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}H_{2}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{2}^{BM}(X)\to H_{2}^{BM}(U)\\\to H_{1}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{1}^{BM}(X)\to H_{1}^{BM}(U)\\\to H_{0}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{0}^{BM}(X)\to H_{0}^{BM}(U)\to 0\end{aligned}}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mtable columnalign="right left right left right left right left right left right left" rowspacing="3pt" columnspacing="0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em 2em 0em" displaystyle="true">
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>2</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>F</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
              </mtd>
              <mtd>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>2</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>X</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>2</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>U</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>1</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>F</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
              </mtd>
              <mtd>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>1</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>X</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>1</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>U</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
            <mtr>
              <mtd>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>0</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>F</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
              </mtd>
              <mtd>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>0</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>X</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
                <msubsup>
                  <mi>H</mi>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mn>0</mn>
                  </mrow>
                  <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
                    <mi>B</mi>
                    <mi>M</mi>
                  </mrow>
                </msubsup>
                <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
                <mi>U</mi>
                <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
                <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
                <mn>0</mn>
              </mtd>
            </mtr>
          </mtable>
        </mrow>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}H_{2}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{2}^{BM}(X)\to H_{2}^{BM}(U)\\\to H_{1}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{1}^{BM}(X)\to H_{1}^{BM}(U)\\\to H_{0}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{0}^{BM}(X)\to H_{0}^{BM}(U)\to 0\end{aligned}}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/70def822eb9b7f2bb2435769caf155ba01aff6b4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -4.338ex; width:41.941ex; height:9.843ex;" alt="{\displaystyle {\begin{aligned}H_{2}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{2}^{BM}(X)\to H_{2}^{BM}(U)\\\to H_{1}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{1}^{BM}(X)\to H_{1}^{BM}(U)\\\to H_{0}^{BM}(F)\to &amp;H_{0}^{BM}(X)\to H_{0}^{BM}(U)\to 0\end{aligned}}}"/></span></p>

<p id="mwARM">Since <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt81" id="mwARQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"F"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle F}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>F</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle F}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/545fd099af8541605f7ee55f08225526be88ce57" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.741ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle F}"/></span> is only three points we have </p>

<p id="mwARU"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt82" id="mwARY" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"H_1^{BM}(F) = H_2^{BM}(F) =0."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}(F)=H_{2}^{BM}(F)=0.}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>F</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>F</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mn>0.</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}(F)=H_{2}^{BM}(F)=0.}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/68d507a13c67372a63f7085663205efa645c8fcf" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:25.726ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}(F)=H_{2}^{BM}(F)=0.}"/></span></p> 

<p id="mwARc">This gives us that <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt83" id="mwARg" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"H_2^{BM}(U) = \\Z."}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{2}^{BM}(U)=\mathbb {Z} .}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
        </mrow>
        <mo>.</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H_{2}^{BM}(U)=\mathbb {Z} .}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/487c095e52b757aad6edcb34b1a93206fe9726db" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:14.197ex; height:3.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{2}^{BM}(U)=\mathbb {Z} .}"/></span> Using Poincare-duality we can compute </p>

<p id="mwARk"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt84" id="mwARo" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"H_0^{BM}(U) = H^2(U) = 0,"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{0}^{BM}(U)=H^{2}(U)=0,}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>0</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <msup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>2</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>=</mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
        <mo>,</mo>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H_{0}^{BM}(U)=H^{2}(U)=0,}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/9cb96f8f12f0ff367d3a5e831172ad2b583ad9e6" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:23.658ex; height:3.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{0}^{BM}(U)=H^{2}(U)=0,}"/></span></p> 

<p id="mwARs">since <span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-inline" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt85" id="mwARw" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{},"body":{"extsrc":"U"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-inline mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" alttext="{\displaystyle U}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mi>U</mi>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle U}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/458a728f53b9a0274f059cd695e067c430956025" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-inline mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -0.338ex; width:1.783ex; height:2.176ex;" alt="{\displaystyle U}"/></span> deformation retracts to a one-dimensional CW-complex. Finally, using the computation for the homology of a compact genus 2 curve we are left with the exact sequence</p>

<p id="mwAR0"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt86" id="mwAR4" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"0 \\to \\Z ^{\\oplus 4} \\to H_1^{BM}(U) \\to \\Z ^{\\oplus 3} \\to \\Z \\to 0"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle 0\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 4}\to H_{1}^{BM}(U)\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 3}\to \mathbb {Z} \to 0}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <mn>0</mn>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>⊕<!-- ⊕ --></mo>
            <mn>4</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>⊕<!-- ⊕ --></mo>
            <mn>3</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
          <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
        </mrow>
        <mo stretchy="false">→<!-- → --></mo>
        <mn>0</mn>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle 0\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 4}\to H_{1}^{BM}(U)\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 3}\to \mathbb {Z} \to 0}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/1d0cfd7694ad9b20bb2f5d1130fb03eb928bf4c4" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:38.614ex; height:3.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle 0\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 4}\to H_{1}^{BM}(U)\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 3}\to \mathbb {Z} \to 0}"/></span></p>

<p id="mwAR8">showing</p>

<p id="mwASA"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt87" id="mwASE" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"H_1^{BM}(U) \\cong \\Z ^{\\oplus 6}"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}(U)\cong \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 6}}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
        <msubsup>
          <mi>H</mi>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mn>1</mn>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi>B</mi>
            <mi>M</mi>
          </mrow>
        </msubsup>
        <mo stretchy="false">(</mo>
        <mi>U</mi>
        <mo stretchy="false">)</mo>
        <mo>≅<!-- ≅ --></mo>
        <msup>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mi mathvariant="double-struck">Z</mi>
          </mrow>
          <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
            <mo>⊕<!-- ⊕ --></mo>
            <mn>6</mn>
          </mrow>
        </msup>
      </mstyle>
    </mrow>
    <annotation encoding="application/x-tex">{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}(U)\cong \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 6}}</annotation>
  </semantics>
</math></span><img src="https://wikimedia.org/api/rest_v1/media/math/render/svg/e4cc8ef92ecdd94f1e0f3f46813847f23ef2d6f9" class="mwe-math-fallback-image-display mw-invert skin-invert" aria-hidden="true" style="vertical-align: -1.005ex; width:15.883ex; height:3.343ex;" alt="{\displaystyle H_{1}^{BM}(U)\cong \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 6}}"/></span></p>

<p id="mwASI">since we have the short exact sequence of free abelian groups</p>

<p id="mwASM"><span class="mwe-math-element mwe-math-element-block" typeof="mw:Extension/math" about="#mwt88" id="mwASQ" data-mw='{"name":"math","attrs":{"display":"block"},"body":{"extsrc":"0 \\to \\Z ^{\\oplus 4} \\to H_1^{BM}(U) \\to \\Z ^{\\oplus 2} \\to 0"}}'><span class="mwe-math-mathml-display mwe-math-mathml-a11y" style="display: none;"><math xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML" display="block" alttext="{\displaystyle 0\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 4}\to H_{1}^{BM}(U)\to \mathbb {Z} ^{\oplus 2}\to 0}">
  <semantics>
    <mrow class="MJX-TeXAtom-ORD">
      <mstyle displaystyle="true" scriptlevel="0">
